pod_map.guide.main.title=Minimap Add-On
pod_map.guide.main.body=§o§7Created by Podcrash§r\n\nThe Minimap Add-On is ready to lead the way! This add-on adds essential utilities for navigating an ever expanding world from waypoints to gravestones we've got you covered. This guidebook will help you explore far and wide. \n\nIf you lose the book you can re-craft it with a book and a §emap§r. You can also access this guide with the command §7/podmap§r at anytime.\n\nFor more information and support, check out §3§ohttps://pdcr.sh/minimap§r
pod_map.guide.exit_button=Exit
pod_map.guide.back_button=Back

pod_map.guide.minimap.title=Minimap
pod_map.guide.minimap.body=Your minimap is an item you spawn with. You'll keep it even if you die.\n\nUse the item to open your minimap. Holding :_input_key.sneak: when using item will instead open map settings menu.\n\n§lMap open§r\nView your surrounding area and the waypoints therein. Interact with the map to create or use waypoints at the location of your cursor.\n\nPress :_input_key.sneak: to open map settings.\n\nPress :_input_key.jump: to close your map.\n\n§lMap settings§r\n§7-§r Zoom can be adjusted from 1 to 5, 5 being zoomed all the way out. \n§7-§r All waypoints in the world can be viewed.\n§7-§r Destination can be cleared if set.\n§7-§r Map can be closed if open.\n\n§lCrafting§r\n1 1 1\n1 2 1\n1 1 1\n\n1 = Gold Nugget\n2 = Empty Map\n\nCrafts 1 Minimap \n§o(Crafted minimaps do drop on death, unlike the one you spawn with)

pod_map.guide.gravestones.title=Gravestones
pod_map.guide.gravestones.body=When you die a waypoint will automatically be created and your items will be safely stored in a gravestone. When you arrive back at your grave you can punch the grave to destroy it and get all your items back.

pod_map.waypoint.looked_at=%1\n§r%2m away

pod_map.settings.title=Settings
pod_map.player_settings.title=Player Settings
pod_map.player_settings.disclaimer=In this menu you will find all your player settings. These settings only affect yourself and other players may set different settings for themselves. Make sure to press the 'Save' button to save your changes!
pod_map.settings.selection_menu.body=Pick between modifying Player or Global Settings. Player Settings will only affect yourself while Global Settings will affect the gameplay from everyone. Please keep in mind that you need permission to modify Global Settings.
pod_map.global_settings.title=Global Settings
pod_map.global_settings.disclaimer=In this menu you will find all global settings. When changing one of these settings, it will affect the gameplay of everyone in the world. If you would like to modify your own preferences instead, click the 'Player Settings' button in the previous menu instead. Make sure to press the 'Save' button to save your changes!
pod_map.global_settings.no_permission=You do not have permission to modify Global Settings! Ask someone with permission to modify Global Settings to add the permission to you or run the command §7/scriptevent %1:allow_global §rto be able to modify global settings. By default, the first player to join the world with the Add-On installed will get the permission to modify global settings.
pod_map.global_settings.permission_granted=§aYou can modify Global Settings now!
pod_map.global_settings.update_permissions.title=Update Permissions
pod_map.global_settings.update_permissions.body=Select one of the players below to modify their permission level! Below their name, you can see their current permission level!
pod_map.global_settings.update_permissions.no_players=There are currently no other players than you that can modify Global Settings! If you would like to grant someone permission to modify Global Settings make sure that they are online!
pod_map.global_settings.update_player_permissions.body=Please select a new permission level for §e%1§r!
